OL,5,G0900 Bargain-Loving Brits in the Sun
OL,6,     FSinger Gemma spices up the Costa
OL,7,     FDel Sol, and the kitchen heats up
OL,8,     Fin Benidorm for a pair of chefs.
OL,9,G1000 The Hotel Inspector
OL,10,     FIn a quaint Essex village, Alex
OL,11,     FPolizzi is called to rescue a
OL,12,     Ffamily-run guest house with tea
OL,13,     Frooms and events facilities. Alex
OL,14,     Fbelieves weddings are the key to
OL,15,     Fthe future of Fraser's.
OL,16,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,17,     FMore than 60 thefts are reported
OL,18,     Fto Derbyshire Police every day. In
OL,19,     Fthis episode, following a rise in
OL,20,     Fthefts across the East Midlands,
OL,21,     Fofficers target organised gangs of
OL,22,     Fthieves.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/9
