OL,5,G1700 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up!
OL,6,     FIn London an estate agent disputes
OL,7,     Fa #6k debt owed to a client as
OL,8,     Ftempers flare and police are
OL,9,     Fcalled. In Sussex, an enforcement
OL,10,     Fagent pursues debts linked to a
OL,11,     Fclosed ice-cream shop.
OL,12,G1800 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FDocumentary series. The doctors
OL,14,     Fdeal with a woman in the midst of
OL,15,     Fa panic attack, a chronic
OL,16,     Fasthmatic, a man who can only eat
OL,17,     Feggs and a harrowing diagnosis of
OL,18,     Fstomach cancer.
