OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FIn Birmingham, tensions rise with
OL,7,     Fan alcohol withdrawal patient and
OL,8,     Fa hit-and-run. In Norwich, Arthur
OL,9,     Fis brought in with serious burns
OL,10,     Fafter saving his sister from a
OL,11,     Fchip pan fire.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Dev needs a delicate hand to
OL,14,     Favoid a crucial nerve on a
OL,15,     Fpatient's forehead; there's a
OL,16,     Fmessy neck cyst for Dr Emma; and
OL,17,     FTeanna asks Dr Natalia to examine
OL,18,     Fa lump caused by a pony bite.
